{"ref":"BDB, מִפְרָשׂ²","hw":"מִפְרָשׂ²","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">מִפְרָשׂ</span>]</big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>spreading out, thing spread</strong>;—sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִפְרָשֵׂךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.7\">Ez 27:7</a> <em>thy spread</em> (canvas, as sail, cf. vb. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.23\">Is 33:23</a>); pl. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִפְרְשֵׂי עָב</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 36:29\" href=\"/Job.36.29\">Jb 36:29</a>, so perhaps <a data-ref=\"Job 37:16\" href=\"/Job.37.16\">37:16</a> (for <span dir=\"rtl\">מִפְלְשֵׂי</span>).","next":"BDB, פַּרְשֵׂז","prev":"BDB, פָּרַשׂ"}